  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一個 Serilum 模組。用心製作。許多活躍的模組支援 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg&w=400\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg&w=400\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"關於模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span>終界傳送門配方是一個讓終界傳送門可以合成、移動，並在生存模式中可取得，以及進行其他調整的模組。由於龍蛋是配方的必要材料，玩家必須在<strong>擊敗終界龍之後</strong>才能製作新的傳送門。不過，玩家仍然可以從要塞中收集傳送門框架方塊，並將它們移動到其他地方。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"依賴項目\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg&w=502\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/modpack/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg&w=700\" alt=\"包含於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-rpg-bundle\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/rpg-bundle.svg&w=668\" alt=\"包含於 Serilum's RPG Bundle\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg&w=440\" alt=\"環境：伺服器端\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"可設定\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/configuration-guide\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg&w=440\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;所有可用的設定選項：</p>\n<details><summary>顯示詳細內容</summary>\n<p><span><strong>mustHaveSilkTouchToBreakPortal</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設：true<br>若啟用，玩家只有在十字鎬上附有絲綢之觸時才能破壞傳送門框架。<br><br><span><strong>addBrokenPortalFramesToInventory</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設：true<br>若啟用，破壞的傳送門框架會直接加入玩家物品欄，以降低其被摧毀的機率。若物品欄已滿，仍會掉落為物品實體。<br><br><span><strong>sendMessageOnExtraDragonEggDrop</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設：true<br>是否應向玩家發送額外龍蛋將掉落位置的訊息。</p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong><strong>功能</strong></strong></span><br><strong><strong>終界龍</strong>&nbsp;現在一定會掉落一顆龍蛋。如果是第一次擊殺，一個會出現在基座上，另一個則會進入玩家的物品欄。</strong><br><br></p>\n<p><strong>終界傳送門現在可以合成，配方如下：</strong><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<em> 5 個終界之眼、1 顆龍蛋、3 顆終界石</em><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/end-portal-recipe/a.jpg\" alt=\"1\" width=\"462\" height=\"207\"><br><br><strong>你可以將傳送門放置在任何地方：<br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/end-portal-recipe/b.jpg\" alt=\"2\" width=\"1138\" height=\"662\"></strong><br><br><strong>在傳送門框架中填入終界之眼：<br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/end-portal-recipe/c.jpg\" alt=\"3\" width=\"1060\" height=\"616\"></strong><br><br><strong>它會變成一個終界傳送門：</strong><br><span><em>務必以正確的方向放置傳送門</em></span><strong>。<br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/end-portal-recipe/e.jpg\" alt=\"5\" width=\"1208\" height=\"702\"></strong><br><br><strong>在生存模式中，你可以用任何十字鎬破壞終界傳送門。這會掉落框架，如果已插入終界之眼，也會一併掉落：</strong><br><em>這也會破壞終界傳送門方塊。</em><br><strong><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/end-portal-recipe/f.jpg\" alt=\"6\" width=\"1423\" height=\"827\"></strong><br><br></p>\n<p><span><strong><strong>新的設定選項；僅能用絲綢之觸破壞框架，並直接轉移至玩家物品欄：</strong></strong><br></span></p>\n<details><summary>顯示詳細內容</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/end-portal-recipe/g.webp\" alt=\"newconfig\" width=\"1000\" height=\"504\"></p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>你可以在任何模組包中自由使用此模組，只要下載檔案仍託管於 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統內即可。</strong></span><br><br><span><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum.com</a> 包含了所有模組的概覽和更多資訊。</span><br><span><br>如有問題、想法、建議或其他事項，請前往 <a href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\">Github 儲存庫</a>。感謝！</span><span><br><br></span></p>",
